{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-44","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：中项无理线段与线段","englishTitle":"A second bimedial straight line is divided at one point only.","book":10,"number":44,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.44","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.44/","group":"prop_1","sourceNumber":44,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-44@raw-594a5f3fb0677a4c","contentId":"euclid-10-44","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"594a5f3fb0677a4cf038d16923d72068bb0a9876b798ece47353ebf7546230f6","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-44.statement","euclid-10-44.construction.1","euclid-10-44.proof.1","euclid-10-44.proof.2","euclid-10-44.proof.3","euclid-10-44.proof.4","euclid-10-44.proof.5","euclid-10-44.proof.6","euclid-10-44.proof.7","euclid-10-44.proof.8","euclid-10-44.proof.9","euclid-10-44.proof.10","euclid-10-44.proof.11","euclid-10-44.proof.12","euclid-10-44.proof.13","euclid-10-44.proof.14","euclid-10-44.proof.15","euclid-10-44.proof.16","euclid-10-44.proof.17","euclid-10-44.proof.18","euclid-10-44.proof.19","euclid-10-44.proof.20","euclid-10-44.conclusion","euclid-10-44.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-44.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-44","revisionId":"euclid-10-44@raw-594a5f3fb0677a4c","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d31a2cd7714526d40aaf271c624dfb4f7a6885cfb8f53cf17e520b2834c5d4b0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"A second bimedial straight line is divided at one point only."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"第二条双中项无理线段直线只分为一个点。（相关点与线段：A）"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-44.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-44","revisionId":"euclid-10-44@raw-594a5f3fb0677a4c","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c1a755e54252a9144fe4c53ca1fc04bc902629ec86daa9d8ab9d7089bba16af9","citations":["euclid-10-38"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be a second bimedial straight line divided at C, so that AC, CB are medial straight lines commensurable in square only and containing a medial rectangle; [[X. 38](/principles/euclid-10-38) ] it is then manifest that C is not at the point of bisection, because the segments are not commensurable in length."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB是第二条双中项无理线段直线,分为C,AC,CB,中项无理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度,含有中项无理线段,矩形 [ [X. 38](/principles/euclid-10-38)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-44.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-44","revisionId":"euclid-10-44@raw-594a5f3fb0677a4c","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"64d8fbeae8b3546e4e83891e26b4827ceadd1171e2f1ef514d17aeb95020a8ca","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that AB is not so divided at another point."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,AB在另一个时候没有如此分裂。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-44.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-44","revisionId":"euclid-10-44@raw-594a5f3fb0677a4c","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e2ddefdbf1e43ca902d7a75ba8f3d4ea3db0d8498184e9bb35d38bca9a026576","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if possible, let it be divided at D also, so that AC is not the same with DB, but AC is supposed greater; it is then clear that the squares on AD, DB are also, as we proved above [Lemma], less than the squares on AC, CB; and suppose that AD, DB are medial straight lines commensurable in square only and containing a medial rectangle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果可能的话,也将其分为D,AC与DB不相同,但AC应该更大;然后可以清楚地看到,正如我们上文所证明的,AD,DB的正方形,也低于AC,CB的正方形;假设AD,DB是中项无理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度,包含中项无理线段,矩形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-44.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-44","revisionId":"euclid-10-44@raw-594a5f3fb0677a4c","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7f793c6472cc2d1339ef793c36fab91cc758aec455e8846dee7d0cd11364aea3","citations":["euclid-2-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now let a rational straight line EF be set out, let there be applied to EF the rectangular parallelogram EK equal to the square on AB, and let EG equal to the squares on AC, CB be subtracted; therefore the remainder HK is equal to twice the rectangle AC, CB. [[II. 4](/principles/euclid-2-4) ]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,请列出有理线段 EF,将长方形平行四边形 EK等于正方形的AB,将EG等于正方形的AC,CB减掉;因此,其余HK等于矩形 AC,CB的两倍 [ [II. 4](/principles/euclid-2-4)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-44.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-44","revisionId":"euclid-10-44@raw-594a5f3fb0677a4c","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b834ff67d258bcd4de275bf09ed3ed4439b956101342b0c2d24c370b938af123","citations":["euclid-10-41"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, let there be subtracted EL, equal to the squares on AD, DB, which were proved less than the squares on AC, CB [[Lemma](/principles/euclid-10-41) ]; therefore the remainder MK is also equal to twice the rectangle AD, DB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"倒数EL,等于AD,DB,经证明低于AC,CB的正方形;因此,其余MK也等于矩形,AD,DB的两倍。 [ [引理](/principles/euclid-10-41)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-44.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-44","revisionId":"euclid-10-44@raw-594a5f3fb0677a4c","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"28ea74ad2cf019b84df535ef1acaefbf1fb858ba211dfcf40acdabf79bdddce4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the squares on AC, CB are medial, therefore EG is medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,AC正方形,CB中项无理线段,EG中项无理线段"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-44.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-44","revisionId":"euclid-10-44@raw-594a5f3fb0677a4c","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"89ec02bf80dc08e57e25ad115dc6b0ebcdaab9fa8258065bcb323790b17a9e97","citations":["euclid-10-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is applied to the rational straight line EF; therefore EH is rational and incommensurable in length with EF. [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22) ]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"适用于有理线段 EF;因此,EH为有理和不可公度为EF [ [X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-44.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-44","revisionId":"euclid-10-44@raw-594a5f3fb0677a4c","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d4abd271a5cdae71f2bdcc897495b86efc3e961830bae8af38324408c79b4a4b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason HN is also rational and incommensurable in length with EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,HN也为有理,不可公度为EF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-44.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-44","revisionId":"euclid-10-44@raw-594a5f3fb0677a4c","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cb26412d888125bbc1ca2f9dd5d4b914ae1040b14852cd8319e26c8463b7b2ed","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AC, CB are medial straight lines commensurable in square only, therefore AC is incommensurable in length with CB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AC,CB是中项无理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度 所以AC是不可公度,CB"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-44.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-44","revisionId":"euclid-10-44@raw-594a5f3fb0677a4c","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"24a1dc141221bbd9a3c10dd84cf981b5c50cf3cb796adb8bf683b33578183ba3","citations":["euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as AC is to CB, so is the square on AC to the rectangle AC, CB; therefore the square on AC is incommensurable with the rectangle AC, CB. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11) ]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,AC对CB的比等于AC对正方形对矩形对AC对CB的比;因此,AC对正方形对不可公度对不可公度对矩形对AC对CB的比。] [ [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-44.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-44","revisionId":"euclid-10-44@raw-594a5f3fb0677a4c","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c1769e66dfcc526277a5f3e037f5e3f69cf887cf425bc0ec870dcd63d092bc30","citations":["euclid-10-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the squares on AC, CB are commensurable with the square on AC; for AC, CB are commensurable in square. [[x. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15) ]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AC的正方形,CB是可公度,AC是正方形;AC,CB是正方形 [ [x. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-44.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-44","revisionId":"euclid-10-44@raw-594a5f3fb0677a4c","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"826c1dc4e82ebe4bbcbba4ad8c931cf3f3decf7ec2282d16ee1f60f461af24b0","citations":["euclid-10-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And twice the rectangle AC, CB is commensurable with the rectangle AC, CB. [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6) ]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"和两倍的矩形 AC,CB是可公度 与矩形 AC,CB [ [X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-44.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-10-44","revisionId":"euclid-10-44@raw-594a5f3fb0677a4c","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b2fe9e008789b6aeba89c991afdde3cf04becab72ccf0e6abf9f05df07bac034","citations":["euclid-10-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the squares on AC, CB are also incommensurable with twice the rectangle AC, CB. [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13) ]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AC和CB正方形也是不可公度,是矩形AC和CB的两倍 [ [X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-44.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-10-44","revisionId":"euclid-10-44@raw-594a5f3fb0677a4c","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e8c6e7302301a29ee6db2fece9179deb9d21f6696f5bc3885362039f91b7aa24","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But EG is equal to the squares on AC, CB, and HK is equal to twice the rectangle AC, CB; therefore EG is incommensurable with HK, so that EH is also incommensurable in length with HN. [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1) , [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11) ]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但EG等于AC,CB的正方形,CB,HK等于矩形,AC,CB的两倍;因此,EG等于不可公度,HK,EH等于不可公度,HN [ [VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1) [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-44.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-10-44","revisionId":"euclid-10-44@raw-594a5f3fb0677a4c","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2268228a5c927edb36c6b6fadca2a9bebb51014db4e99a5a9b94eea796f2b69e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And they are rational; therefore EH, HN are rational straight lines commensurable in square only."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"它们是有理,EH,HN,有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-44.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-10-44","revisionId":"euclid-10-44@raw-594a5f3fb0677a4c","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"352a27ac13102f98128c7b90e762d7596ff769e0e1f9de97ce4d9fdaffec4140","citations":["euclid-10-36"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if two rational straight lines commensurable in square only be added together, the whole is the irrational which is called binomial. [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36) ]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果把两个有理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度加在一起, 整个就是无理, 叫做二项无理线段 [ [X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-44.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-10-44","revisionId":"euclid-10-44@raw-594a5f3fb0677a4c","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a94d6d3a2210f2314b3b4b1ead9cb9003ea6f4146c14fdc5ccea23fa892d0a30","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore EN is a binomial straight line divided at H."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,EN是一条二项无理线段直线,分为H。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-44.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-10-44","revisionId":"euclid-10-44@raw-594a5f3fb0677a4c","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a01eb51e4ac21e687615011fb6715393f4cc0401015179908c95563a7fe55238","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"In the same way EM, MN will also be proved to be rational straight lines commensurable in square only; and EN will be a binomial straight line divided at different points, H and M."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,EM、MN也将证明为有理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度;EN将分为二项无理线段直线,分到H和M不同点。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-44.proof.18","contentId":"euclid-10-44","revisionId":"euclid-10-44@raw-594a5f3fb0677a4c","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 18","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0e2d398b3d5be41ebef8b70b548b21f423bbfe7cae9a4c401faa86a13e15b389","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And EH is not the same with MN."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"EH和MN不一样"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-44.proof.19","contentId":"euclid-10-44","revisionId":"euclid-10-44@raw-594a5f3fb0677a4c","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 19","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"75225cd5a65058ae94a62f4c19ce6a2913c22cfb54ff9b834f8df25aca5d23fb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the squares on AC, CB are greater than the squares on AD, DB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AC的正方形,CB的AC超过AD的正方形,DB的AC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-44.proof.20","contentId":"euclid-10-44","revisionId":"euclid-10-44@raw-594a5f3fb0677a4c","order":21,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 20","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7475985af19f236b73458d81d0b1ed7766340488ee2de2858e9717383a9878c0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the squares on AD, DB are greater than twice the rectangle AD, DB; therefore also the squares on AC, CB, that is, EG, are much greater than twice the rectangle AD, DB, that is, MK, so that EH is also greater than MN."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,AD,DB的正方形比矩形,AD,DB的两倍;因此,AC,CB的正方形,即EG,大大高于矩形,AD,DB,即MK,EH,也大于MN。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-44.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-44","revisionId":"euclid-10-44@raw-594a5f3fb0677a4c","order":22,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"668c5303edf24b34ca43215f3ba7afff019659b475d638895fa7421b58f963cd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore EH is not the same with MN. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,EH项与MN项不同,Q项,D项。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-44.source","contentId":"euclid-10-44","revisionId":"euclid-10-44@raw-594a5f3fb0677a4c","order":23,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"45b99e31f4b4490a8725077fb31fa4e8f5034f59a124d9bc03fe39178ea37f55","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.44/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg0